    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/a7ba7fbb3b99b34d270a80f342e0352d.avif?t=1739803072\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><br><br>&quot;BOKKIE&quot; is a chilling mascot horror game set in a kindergarten and school where a dark secret lies beneath\u2014a toys factory run by the school's director. The once-friendly BOKKIE toys are now malevolent and roaming free. As a detective, explore the eerie school, solve puzzles, and confront haunted toys to unravel the sinister mysteries hidden within the shadows. Brace yourself for a short, intense adventure where reality and nightmare collide in &quot;BOKKIE.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/027238daa2ca3391d15f36c6855f9779.webp?t=1739803072\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br><br>Your mission is to navigate the labyrinthine corridors of the kindergarten and the  toy factory, solving puzzles, avoiding haunted toys, and unravelling the dark secrets that have been hidden for years. BOKKIE, the imposing bear toy, will stop at nothing to protect its realm, making your journey a heart-pounding race against time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.poster.avif?t=1739803072\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.webm?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.mp4?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To progress deeper into the factory, you must solve intricate puzzles left behind by the enigmatic creators of BOKKIE. Uncover hidden passages, decipher cryptic messages, and manipulate the environment to unlock the secrets that bind the haunted toys to their spectral existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/825cdee7a4d6e614c69a563d69e55de5.poster.avif?t=1739803072\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/825cdee7a4d6e614c69a563d69e55de5.webm?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/825cdee7a4d6e614c69a563d69e55de5.mp4?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/45ec86afe0d2b5c9b126ddaedd16a43e.webp?t=1739803072\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br><br>- Great horror experience <br>- Full main menu and settings ( Graphics - Audio - Controlls ) <br>- CCTV System to watch the toys <br>- Immersive and atmospheric exploration of a haunted kindergarten and toy factory.<br>- Challenging puzzles and mind-bending riddles that test your problem-solving skills.<br>- Heart-stopping encounters with a variety of haunted toys, each with its own unique abilities.<br>- Intense boss battle against BOKKIE, the formidable bear toy.<br>- Uncover a captivating storyline filled with twists, turns, and unexpected revelations.<br><br><br>Dive into this great horror experience in the empty kindergarten to the old abandoned toys factory , will you escape them ?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/a7ba7fbb3b99b34d270a80f342e0352d.avif?t=1739803072\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><br><br>&quot;BOKKIE&quot; is a chilling mascot horror game set in a kindergarten and school where a dark secret lies beneath\u2014a toys factory run by the school's director. The once-friendly BOKKIE toys are now malevolent and roaming free. As a detective, explore the eerie school, solve puzzles, and confront haunted toys to unravel the sinister mysteries hidden within the shadows. Brace yourself for a short, intense adventure where reality and nightmare collide in &quot;BOKKIE.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/027238daa2ca3391d15f36c6855f9779.webp?t=1739803072\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br><br>Your mission is to navigate the labyrinthine corridors of the kindergarten and the  toy factory, solving puzzles, avoiding haunted toys, and unravelling the dark secrets that have been hidden for years. BOKKIE, the imposing bear toy, will stop at nothing to protect its realm, making your journey a heart-pounding race against time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.poster.avif?t=1739803072\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.webm?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880530/extras/6c3a5078b0e7f162e1c5fff711debd61.mp4?t=1739803072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To progress deeper into the factory, you must solve intricat